### Get current user

GET {{Gatway_HostAddress}}/api/users/current
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}


### Get all users
GET {{Gatway_HostAddress}}/api/users/all-users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}


### logout user

POST {{Gatway_HostAddress}}/api/users/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}


### Delete user by ID

DELETE {{Gatway_HostAddress}}/api/users/{userId}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

